    <item>
      <title>Jobs ETL</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/project/jobs-etl/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 04 Mar 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/project/jobs-etl/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;A dashboard served by a pipeline orchestrated using Dagster to extract job postings from various job boards, deduplicate them, load into a PostgreSQL database, and transform via dbt and OpenAI each night. Additionally, a containerized FastAPI service behind NGINX provides secure RESTful endpoints exposing the pipeline outputs.&lt;/p&gt;
